l shortcut for the 33 names it lists. Never tell the model to type a slash command. Ask the user to type one only when the model cannot read the file. Document the per-runtime table from section 2.8 in `skill-advisor-hook.md` and add the DSH row.\n\n  Line 180: - **Evidence.** Section 2.8. The typed path on Codex, Pi and DSH is already this instruction (C35). The Skill tool misses 12 create commands (C33).\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"^## 2\\\\.8|^### 2\\\\.8|2\\\\.8\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/synthesis-review.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794532177684,"end":1794532178317}}}}
